        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Worldview Entertainment\n- Films: Child 44, Birdman, Blood Ties, The Green Inferno, Killer Joe, Handsome Harry\n- People: Daniel Espinosa, Richard Price, Tom Rob Smith, Jamey Sheridan, Steve Buscemi, Aidan Quinn\n- Topics: independent film production, film financing\n\nFacts:\n- Worldview Entertainment is an American independent motion picture company that finances and produces theatrical-quality feature films for worldwide distribution.\n- Handsome Harry was the first project produced by Worldview Entertainment.\n- Handsome Harry stars Jamey Sheridan, Steve Buscemi, and Aidan Quinn.\n- Worldview Entertainment produced films including Birdman, Blood Ties, The Green Inferno, Killer Joe, and Child 44.\n- Child 44 is a 2015 mystery thriller film.\n- Child 44 was directed by Daniel Espinosa and written by Richard Price.\n- Child 44 is based on Tom Rob Smith's 2008 novel of the same name.",
